In the method we assume that index is less than or equal to the count of arraylist and it is also non negative. It then store the original count, index of x, last index of x and presence of x in arraylist.

Then the method calls the Insert(index, x) method.

After the method call, we again store the count, index of x, last index of x and presence of x in arraylist.

Then on calling PexObserve.ValueForViewing we are providing all the values which was used in assertions.

In the end it invokes an assertion "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that last position of x after insertion is less than or equal to original array count. In order to test this, "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" should be replaced with the actual assertion which is not covered here. 

This method should work for all inputs because the Precondition is assured by PexAssumeUnderTest.
```python
# Here is the Python code for this test-case

# Define the test function
def PUT_InsertContract(arrayList, x, index):

    # Store the original values
    old_arrListCount = arrayList.Count
    old_x = x
    old_index = index
    old_arrListIndexOfX = arrayList.IndexOf(x)
    old_arrListLastIndexOfX = arrayList.LastIndexOf(x)
    old_arrListContainsX = arrayList.Contains(x)

    # Insert the value at the specified index
    arrayList.Insert(index, x)

    # Store the new values
    new_arrListCount = arrayList.Count
    new_arrListIndexOfX = arrayList.IndexOf(x)
    new_arrListLastIndexOfX = arrayList.LastIndexOf(x)
    new_arrListContainsX = arrayList.Contains(x)

    # Assertions
    assert old_arrListCount > new_arrListCount, "The count of the arrayList should be increased after insertion"
    assert old_arrListIndexOfX <= index <= old_arrListCount, "The position of x after insertion should be less than or equal to the original array count"
    assert old_x == x, "The value x should remain unchanged"
    assert old_index == index, "The index should remain unchanged"
    assert old_arrListIndexOfX == new_arrListIndexOfX, "The position of x in the arrayList should remain unchanged"
    assert old_arrListLastIndexOfX == new_arrListLastIndexOfX, "The last position of x in the arrayList should remain unchanged"
    assert old_arrListContainsX == new_arrListContainsX, "The presence of x in the arrayList should remain unchanged"

    # Print the values for observation
    print("Old arrList Count:", old_arrListCount)
    print("New arrList Count:", new_arrListCount)
    print("Old arrList x:", old_x)
    print("Old arrList index:", old_index)
    print("Old arrList IndexOf x:", old_arrListIndexOfX)
    print("New arrList IndexOf x:", new_arrListIndexOfX)
    print("Old arrList LastIndexOf x:", old_arrListLastIndexOfX)
    print("New arrList LastIndexOf x:", new_arrListLastIndexOfX)
    print("Old arrList Contains x:", old_arrListContainsX)
    print("New arrList Contains x:", new_arrListContainsX)

# Call the test function
PUT_InsertContract(myArrayList, x, index)
```

Above given code is written in Python syntax, it works exactly as explained in C# syntax part. First we are storing all the original information and after Insert operation we are again storing new information. Finally according to the insertion operation properties, assertions are written there.

Please replace `myArrayList, x, index` with your arraylist instance and the values you want to insert. Ensure that all your imports are compatible with Python and replace List operations as per Python syntax.

This method should be passed with a list and other values and will assert the properties of list post insert operation.

Also, keep in mind we are inserting x into the ArrayList at index, the position of x now is index and its old position is less than or equal to the old--------------------            PexAssert.AreNotEqual(New_arrListIndexOfX, IndexOfX, "$insert(0,_).LastIndexOf(x) != LastIndexOf(x)");
	
	    // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ last position of x after insertion is not changed 
            PexAssert.AreEqual(New_arrListLastIndexOfX, Old_arrListLastIndexOfX, "$insert(0,_).LastIndexOf(x) changed");
	    // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@  count after insertion is x more than before insertion
            PexAssert.AreEqual(New_arrListCount, Old_arrListCount + 1, "$insert(0,_).count != count + 1");
	    // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ x exists in array list after insertion
            PexAssert.IsTrue(New_arrListContainsX, "$insert(0,_).contains(x)");
	    // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ order after insertion is not changed
            PexAssert.IsNull(CheckChangedOrder(Old_arrListCount, Old_index, arrList));
	    // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ new x last index is less than original x last index or equal to original x last index 
            PexAssert.IsTrue((New_arrListLastIndexOfX == Old_arrListLastIndexOfX || New_arrListLastIndexOfX == Old_arrListCount), "$insert(0,_).LastIndexOf(x) isn't correct");
        }
    }
}
```

- `$old_arrList_Count`, `$new_arrList_Count`: 插入操作前的数组的容量和插入操作后的数组的容量。
- `$old_arrList_x`: 要插入的值x。
- `$old_arrList_index`: 要插入的位置的索引。
- `$old_arrList_IndexOf_x`: 在插入操作前的数组中，值为x的索引。
- `$new_arrList_IndexOf_x`: 在插尔操作后的数组中，值为x的索引。
- `$old_arrList_LastIndexOf_x`: 在插入操作前的数组中，值为x的最后一个索引。
- `$new_arrList_LastIndexOf_x`: 在插入操作后的数组中，值为x的最后一个索引。
- `$old_arrList_contains_x`: 在插入操作前的数组中，是否包含值为x的布尔值。
- `$new_arrList_contains_x`: 在插入操作后的数组中，是否包含值为x的布尔值。

断言：

- 断言1：插入操作后数组的容量应该增加1，即`$new_arrList_Count`应该等于`$old_arrList_Count + 1`。
- 断言2：在插入操作后的数组中，值为x的索引应该等于`$old_arrList_IndexOf_x`或者等于`$new_arrList_Count`。
- 断言3：在插入操作后的数组中，值为x的最后一个索引应该等于`$old_arrList_LastIndexOf_x + 1`。
- 断言4：在插入操作后的数组中，是否包含值为x应该是`true`。
- 断署5：在插入操作后的数组中，元素的顺序应该和在插入操作前保持一致，即`CheckChangedOrder($old_arrList_Count, $old_arrList_index, arrList)`应该返回null，表示没有改变元素的顺序。
- 断署6：在插入操作后的数组中，新插入的x的最后一个位置应该是原始的x最后一个位置。
- 断署7：新插入的x的最后一个位置应该是原来x最后一个位置所在的索引，或者是新插入位置的索引，取决于是否有其他相同的x。--------------------            // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" is equal value to old array at this position
            Debug.Assert(New_arrListIndexOfX == Old_index);
            Debug.Assert(New_arrListIndexOfX == Old_arrListIndexOfX);
            Debug.Assert(New_arrListContainsX == true);
            if (index != 0)
            {
                Debug.Assert(Old_arrListIndexOfX >= index && arrList[New_arrListIndexOfX] == Old_x);
            }
            else
            {
                Debug.Assert(arrList[index] == x);
            }

            Debug.Assert(New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount + 1);
        }
    }
}
```

